    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期一期艺聊是北电表演系芊芊师姐与青年演员栋栋学长的对谈，栋栋分享了在北电表演系本硕7年的经历，力图打破大家对表演专业的刻板印象。成为一个优秀青年演员，从一开始就只有努力这一个选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>芊芊师姐：北电硕士，大学老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>栋栋师哥：北电本硕，青年话剧演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期关键时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 栋栋师哥的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 表演系如何保研？黑幕存在吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 考北电有黑幕吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 四年本科与三年硕士的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> 跨考表演系，真的有必要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 本科表演生考研的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 表演毕业生的就业现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 考剧团的建议！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 打破刻板印象！7年表演学习的自我提升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 片尾曲《赞美诗》（赞诗）</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：yitudengdeng</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：北电芊芊师姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：艺术学考研站台/艺兔考研</span></p><span></span><p><span>————谢谢大家————</span></p>]]></description>
