  <item>
    <title>Ep2 | 如何让“艺术概论”先读薄再变厚：J人和P人的两种学习套路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667aa8b61d87fbc3610ca2fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667aa8b61d87fbc3610ca2fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jun 2024 11:23:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期“一期艺聊”聚焦《艺术概论》如何读薄与再补充的问题，由两位中国艺术研究院上岸学姐橙子和橘子与弗朗学长的对谈。性格慢热的橙子学姐跨考三战上岸，目的性强的橘子学姐则是一次上岸，她们分别介绍了两种属于不同性格的备考生的《艺术概论》学习策略～大家可以对号入座。虽然她们的复习策略不尽相同，但却共同强调了艺术概论先读薄再补充的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘子：中国艺术研究院电影学专业在读，专业一130+</span></p><span></span><p><span>橙子：中国艺术研究院电影学专业在读，专业一120+</span></p><span></span><p><span>弗朗：北京电影学院电影理论硕士，专业一140+</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1 艺术概论如何变薄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 橘子的方法：话题导向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 橙子的方法：不断整理属于自己的框架！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 什么时候做完“变薄”这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 2 艺术概论如何变厚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 橘子：艺术史补充翻目录，只看需要的案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> 橘子：美学史补充依托真题，要广泛但不要精</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 橙子：举例子就举自己专业二的例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 艺术概论答题举例子，到底是用艺术史还是自己的专业二？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 3 &nbsp;7月艺术概论复习建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 还没开始复习的同学第一时间做好变薄的工作，保分。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 已经复习完第一轮的同学利用暑期多复习美学史，提分。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 两种复习策略的回顾与梳理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 最终总复习时，还得再变薄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 备考资料选择：薄资料还是厚资料？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1557">25:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1719">28:39</a> 番外：备考时要不要定一个高标准理想分数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 片尾曲《且听风吟》（朴树）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（打一个小广告：站台碰巧也有艺术概论变薄的小册子以及变厚的艺术史和美学史册子，欢迎大家加微信试读）</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：yitudengdeng</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：艺术学上岸站台</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：艺术学考研站台</span></p>]]></description>
