    <title>Ep1 | “不跨考也是零基础”：美术学考研上岸学姐小熊的乐天派发言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667432deb6a84127292d8ddd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667432deb6a84127292d8ddd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 13:47:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是“一期艺聊”是真正意义上的第一期，由北京电影学院美术系上岸学姐小熊与弗朗学长的对谈。可爱的小熊学姐作为一个本科虽没有跨考但却基本零基础的“普通美术生”，分享了一路上复习艺术概论的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> “我没跨考也是零基础啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 用思维导图学艺术概论和艺术史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 押题！押题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a> 用艺术史补充艺术概论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 复试还有可能考察基本知识</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 好心态来自想的少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 边画画边听带背音频</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 递进的学习时间安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 焦虑本身是件好事！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 考研竟然还有四次崩溃阶段？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 片尾曲《深呼吸》</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注我们：一起分享大家的考研趣事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：yitudengdeng</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：艺术学上岸站台</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：艺术学考研站台</span></p>]]></description>
